# 🎨 Comic Creator AI

Comic Creator AI is a Python-based web application built with Streamlit that helps users create comic stories using AI. The application provides a simple and interactive interface for generating creative comic content.

## 🚀 Features

- ✨ AI-powered comic story creation
- 📝 Generate creative comic scenes and dialogues
- 🎭 Create characters and story ideas
- 🖥️ Simple and interactive Streamlit interface
- 🐍 Built using Python
- ⚡ Easy to run locally

## 🛠️ Technologies Used

- Python
- Streamlit
- Artificial Intelligence (AI)

